    "1d92df70-e5f8-4304-ab3f-58b7da1b0129/EventContent": {
      "en": "With rocks arching and embracing, and the water a faint blue,<NL>the pool is encircled by several slender willows and orchid grass, occasionally attracting birds to perch and flit about.<NL>The Jiao egg is quietly lying among the sand and gravel at the bottom of the pool, waiting for the day when the Jiao cracks the shell...",
