    "98e99ed7-b273-4338-853d-a62fd304ebba/EventContent": {
      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name /> observes <JiaoLoong key=JiaoId str=JiaoLoongName/> attentively,<NL>acting to meet its needs and cater to its preferences, softly calling out from time to time and comforting it with <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> hands.<NL><Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name /> spends the entire day by its side. They seem to have fostered an intimate bond...<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(After careful nurturing, <JiaoLoong key=JiaoId str=JiaoLoongName/> appears to be even more tame...)</color>",
