      "en": "<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name /> requests the villagers to observe <JiaoLoong key=JiaoId str=JiaoLoongName/> attentively,<NL>acting to meet its needs and cater to its preferences, softly calling out from time to time and comforting it with <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> hands.<NL>They spend the entire day by its side. They seem to have fostered an intimate bond...<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(After careful nurturing, <JiaoLoong key=JiaoId str=JiaoLoongName/> appears to be even more tame...)</color>",
