    "f26068f5-a380-481f-bcb2-d00240f47460/EventContent": {
      "en": "At the edge of the Jiao Pool, the scenery remains pristine.<NL><JiaoLoong key=JiaoId str=JiaoLoongName/>'s shining scales reflect the sunlight, its majestic form indicating that it has matured.<NL>At this moment, it is coiled on the rocks, its gaze sharp as lightning, its roar echoing like thunder, exuding an imposing aura even though it is not angry...",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
